<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-H.P. Bulmer cut at Goldman.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-H.P. Bulmer cut at Goldman.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK cider maker H.P. Bulmer Holdings Plc was cut to &quot;market performer&quot; from &quot;market outperformer&quot; at Goldman Sachs, the investment bank said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Further detail was not immediately available.</p>
<p>The stock was down 4p at 575 by 1032 GMT.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
